.TH UCABLE-AGENT 1 "2026-10-13" "ucabled" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ucable\-agent \- per\-user session agent for ucabled
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ucable\-agent
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ucable\-agent
registers with the system daemon over D\-Bus and, on request, spawns the UI
helper to show the QR code or the device\-selection window.
It is normally started by systemd as a user service
.RB ( ucable\-agent.service )
and takes no options.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B UCABLED_HELPER
UI helper to spawn: an absolute path, or a bare name resolved through
.BR PATH .
Defaults to the bundled
.BR ucable\-agent\-helper .
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Tracing filter, defaulting to
.BR info .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ucabled (1),
.BR ucable\-agent\-helper (1),
.I docs/helper-contract.md
